  "implementation": [
    "Core ReservedFile helper is the sole create/exclusive/unlink/physical-reserve/length authority; existing mapped allocator delegates to it.",
    "Parked spill streams existing coefficient slices directly to FD, syncs, releases original native owners and replaces BOTH compact views with empty slices while retaining logs/root. No initial mapping or second wide native buffer.",
    "Restore first checks callback then own intrusive registry before interpreting context; exact descriptor identities/count/logs/offsets/root and empty/resident views are validated before read-only mmap and infallible full publish.",
    "Store is stable-address/move-only after use and outlives trees; actual tree owner allocator/budget lease stays alive for private owner data. Unrelated Scheme shell allocations retain caller lifetime.",
    "Workers keep the actual Store from successful spill and restore only after INTER commit; metadata-only actualRoots checks work before restoring.",
    "No MAP_FIXED, witness/VM/Tape replay, commit FFT replay, root or channel mutation. Ordinary downstream composition/sampling FFTs remain.",
    "Disk lease counters and mapped retained-lease counters are separate. Default Store.init still maps; initParked is opt-in."
  ],
